      <p>When you configure your Windows VMs correctly, they activate automatically with the {"{"}{"{"} aws_short {"}"}{"}"} Key Management Service (KMS), and run using optimized drivers for the underlying bare-metal hardware. Proper configuration also ensures that billing is correct.</p>
      <p>If you do not configure your Windows VMs so that they are license-compliant, they might fail to activate, suffer degraded system performance due to sub-optimal CPU pinning, and risk failing a licensing audit.</p>
